#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087886 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087456 :question/id #uuid "34c357f1-505b-530f-8bb4-376eada248a9" :question/math-academy-id "e-2301" :question/problem "Use the transformation $y = vx$  (where $v=v(x)$) to rewrite the given first-order homogeneous ODE \n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}y} {\\textrm{d}x}    =   \\cos \\left( \\frac {y} {x} \\right)\n$$\n\nas a separable ODE in $v$ and $x.$" :question/worked-solution "With $y = vx$ (where $v = v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nPlugging that into the differential equation and separating variables, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{y}{x}\\right) \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(v) \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(v)-v \\\\ \\left(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(v)-v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a8edbecf-59d3-5f32-a0ac-d6e8f2128dc0" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186673489 :question-generator/id #uuid "06ae56ab-b6a9-575d-9489-bf4b78e547bb" :question-generator/script "generators/ad/ad3b69904f4bd93852b4de4a1708cfae2752ae81dc5f539e150b0fbb1f1aaa1f/17592186087886.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088008 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4514e843-dc0c-5be5-9e96-42ad1bfc870e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{v+1}{{v}^{2}+1}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272978} {:answer/id #uuid "680783c7-a79b-52f6-8c63-e5a4705ea03c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{v+1}{2{v}^{2}-v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273285} {:answer/id #uuid "7a0d77cc-d328-5023-810b-e3a1f565a8d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{2{v}^{2}-v}{v+1}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273437} {:answer/id #uuid "b9914a60-1aeb-5bf6-9bfb-f20416011265" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{v+1}{2{v}^{3}-{v}^{2}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273999} {:answer/id #uuid "f794ae15-8082-5a6e-b5d7-76a88fb45ece" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{{v}^{2}+v}{3{v}^{2}-v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274558}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "680783c7-a79b-52f6-8c63-e5a4705ea03c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{v+1}{2{v}^{2}-v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273285} :answer-field/id #uuid "e7c0796e-4620-5dae-9cfd-a686aee98f07" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186275042}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "695b49d1-9327-503a-b244-1f7f385f59ff" :question/math-academy-id "q-14315" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3{y}^{3}}{x{y}^{2}+y{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?" :question/worked-solution "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3{y}^{3}}{x{y}^{2}+y{x}^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{3(vx)^{3}}{x(vx)^{2}+(vx){x}^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{3{v}^{3}{x}^{3}}{v{x}^{3}(v+1)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{3{v}^{3}\\cancel{{x}^{3}}}{v\\cancel{{x}^{3}}(v+1)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3{v}^{2}}{v+1}-v \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3{v}^{2}}{v+1}-\\frac{v(v+1)}{v+1} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3{v}^{2}-{v}^{2}-v}{v+1} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{2{v}^{2}-v}{v+1} \\\\ \\left(\\frac{v+1}{2{v}^{2}-v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088439 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fb6dd3b-cac4-56a1-b66d-59181029c178" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186351700} {:answer/id #uuid "6c07fbd9-126c-50e4-9dbf-421b28f03956" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2v+\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352523} {:answer/id #uuid "b595eb22-625b-5bb1-8e42-847d5c60fc39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353123} {:answer/id #uuid "d4a7e3b8-ab6a-52d1-a9b2-9dae8f6322f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353410} {:answer/id #uuid "d6351ed0-f215-5d36-b70b-cf1350e332e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{v+\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353422}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0fb6dd3b-cac4-56a1-b66d-59181029c178" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186351700} :answer-field/id #uuid "d40102e8-bbfb-507e-87af-b7854b0ffc32" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186354175}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6aa0e045-65b8-5bd8-8a66-10e8e133beb0" :question/math-academy-id "q-8745" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)+\\frac{y}{x}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?" :question/worked-solution "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)+\\frac{y}{x} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\left(\\frac{x}{vx}\\right)+\\frac{vx}{x} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)+v \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right) \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)} \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275106 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "38a63a78-d8f8-520d-9e1a-a547cbc802ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{{v}^{2}}\\right)+2v)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272882} {:answer/id #uuid "5798a05b-9e8b-5365-ba0d-17eaf8a8607b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)+v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273138} {:answer/id #uuid "610c7517-5cb8-53dc-8041-977fdbde02dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{{v}^{2}}\\right)+2v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273226} {:answer/id #uuid "6dd95ac9-8774-563b-bda6-a758e1302a3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{v}\\right)+2{v}^{2})\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273341} {:answer/id #uuid "df13e973-3a12-5311-937b-d3dcae4d2226" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{{v}^{2}}\\right))\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274354}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "610c7517-5cb8-53dc-8041-977fdbde02dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{{v}^{2}}\\right)+2v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273226} :answer-field/id #uuid "15ca98bc-dec3-575a-b42c-45d374e930cf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274674}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "b4e19450-4e51-548d-b019-a1f8398b116f" :question/math-academy-id "q-14314" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{2}}\\right)+\\frac{3y}{x}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?" :question/worked-solution "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{y}^{2}}\\right)+\\frac{3y}{x} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{v}^{2}{x}^{2}}\\right)+\\frac{3vx}{x} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{{v}^{2}}\\right)+3v \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{{v}^{2}}\\right)+2v \\\\ \\left(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{1}{{v}^{2}}\\right)+2v}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275107 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "03125177-b036-57f5-a72a-3f4420748f87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{v}^{2}+1}{1+v+4{v}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272411} {:answer/id #uuid "28abf496-f945-5a46-836c-05b71cb7c41f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{v}^{2}+1}{1-2v+{v}^{2}-{v}^{3}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272747} {:answer/id #uuid "6576c1eb-f6de-5994-856a-222b13c2c25f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1-3v-4{v}^{2}}{1+{v}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273255} {:answer/id #uuid "67a7dc74-a18e-510b-960e-2d9d5a7efdaa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{v}^{2}+1}{1-v-{v}^{3}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273280} {:answer/id #uuid "f3fe81de-e037-50b5-aa26-4a8e804b13c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{v}^{2}+1}{1-3v-4{v}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274541}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "28abf496-f945-5a46-836c-05b71cb7c41f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{v}^{2}+1}{1-2v+{v}^{2}-{v}^{3}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272747} :answer-field/id #uuid "90700ab5-eeb4-56f3-8e94-25230b50b1ca" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274880}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f48980a9-f2e7-5b29-aaff-6351dbf19d07" :question/math-academy-id "q-14316" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{{x}^{2}-xy+{y}^{2}}{{y}^{2}+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?" :question/worked-solution "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{x}^{2}-xy+{y}^{2}}{{y}^{2}+{x}^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{{x}^{2}-x(vx)+(vx)^{2}}{(vx)^{2}+{x}^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{{x}^{2}(1-v+{v}^{2})}{{x}^{2}({v}^{2}+1)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{1-v+{v}^{2}}{{v}^{2}+1} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1-v+{v}^{2}}{{v}^{2}+1}-v \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1-v+{v}^{2}-{v}^{3}-v}{{v}^{2}+1} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1-2v+{v}^{2}-{v}^{3}}{{v}^{2}+1} \\\\ \\frac{{v}^{2}+1}{1-2v+{v}^{2}-{v}^{3}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275112 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3a81aecc-db87-5864-bf4a-a412676cae3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{v}^{2}-1}{1-2{v}^{3}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272896} {:answer/id #uuid "665d6fcb-2060-5376-afc2-497f1e6ffabe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{v}^{3}+2{v}^{2}}{1-{v}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273264} {:answer/id #uuid "7e690b1e-0568-56f8-9cca-4a717d1758a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{v}^{2}+2v}{1-{v}^{2}-2{v}^{3}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273470} {:answer/id #uuid "90821e35-81ef-5b74-b430-242af8a269fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{v+2}{1-3v-2{v}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273644} {:answer/id #uuid "cc67682d-4991-58c9-b814-c26b2c002615" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1-2v-3{v}^{2}}{{v}^{2}+2v}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274165}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7e690b1e-0568-56f8-9cca-4a717d1758a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{v}^{2}+2v}{1-{v}^{2}-2{v}^{3}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273470} :answer-field/id #uuid "bcef863b-24d8-5be2-a251-e922d0413380" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274967}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "590e41cc-f7e5-52a9-8e4b-08ef663bf420" :question/math-academy-id "q-14323" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{{x}^{3}+x{y}^{2}-{y}^{3}}{x{y}^{2}+2y{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?" :question/worked-solution "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{x}^{3}+x{y}^{2}-{y}^{3}}{x{y}^{2}+2y{x}^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{{x}^{3}+x(vx)^{2}-(vx)^{3}}{x(vx)^{2}+2(vx){x}^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{{x}^{3}(1+{v}^{2}-{v}^{3})}{{x}^{3}({v}^{2}+2v)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{1+{v}^{2}-{v}^{3}}{{v}^{2}+2v} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1+{v}^{2}-{v}^{3}}{{v}^{2}+2v}-v \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1+{v}^{2}-{v}^{3}-{v}^{3}-2{v}^{2}}{{v}^{2}+2v} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1-{v}^{2}-2{v}^{3}}{{v}^{2}+2v} \\\\ \\frac{{v}^{2}+2v}{1-{v}^{2}-2{v}^{3}}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186354571 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0824f56f-20f9-5a23-a152-8fec76baadc5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{e}^{\\operatorname{cos}⁡v}+3}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186351637} {:answer/id #uuid "c63c9edf-13ba-5348-a784-f544f8f7798a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "({e}^{\\operatorname{sin}⁡v}-3{v}^{2})\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353287} {:answer/id #uuid "c7bb8d1f-0d25-549e-bf56-0e3e7da24b29" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{e}^{\\operatorname{cos}⁡v}-5v}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186353298} {:answer/id #uuid "ea09a4b8-ac8e-5fa4-97cc-6fd6b8f5c6b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{e}^{\\operatorname{sin}⁡v}\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x